The types of a trust-mode configuration (GENERATED by tools/bees_pack_gen.py; Silica has no type alias, so an
application spells them).

cfg (the value of (:ok, cfg)):
{ limits: { args_len_max: int64, frame_size_max: int64, suspicion_limit: int64, term_depth_max: int64 }, net: { listen_address: string, listener: string, plaintext_test_only: boolean, port: int64 }, node: { creation: int64, name: string }, peers: List[{ cert: string, classical: boolean, fp: string, spec: { all: string, perms: List[{ a: int64, f: string, m: string }, mem(normal)] } }, mem(normal)], pins: List[{ addr: string, fp: string }, mem(normal)], session: { idle_ms: int64, max_age_ms: int64, max_inflight: int64, more: { drain_ms: int64, max_calls: int64 } }, time: { call_timeout_ms: int64, connect_stagger_ms: int64, connect_timeout_ms: int64, more: { client_handshake_timeout: int64, dns_ns_timeout_ms: int64, dns_total_timeout_ms: int64, first_frame_timeout_ms: int64 } }, tls: { ca_pem: string, cert_pem: string, key_pem: string, self_fp: string }, token: { token_bytes: int64, token_ttl_sec: int64, whitelist_autoload: boolean, whitelist_default_spec: string } }

reason (the value of (:error, reason)):
{ record: int64, schema: int64, text: string }

the reader actor's message to the application:
(:ok, { limits: { args_len_max: int64, frame_size_max: int64, suspicion_limit: int64, term_depth_max: int64 }, net: { listen_address: string, listener: string, plaintext_test_only: boolean, port: int64 }, node: { creation: int64, name: string }, peers: List[{ cert: string, classical: boolean, fp: string, spec: { all: string, perms: List[{ a: int64, f: string, m: string }, mem(normal)] } }, mem(normal)], pins: List[{ addr: string, fp: string }, mem(normal)], session: { idle_ms: int64, max_age_ms: int64, max_inflight: int64, more: { drain_ms: int64, max_calls: int64 } }, time: { call_timeout_ms: int64, connect_stagger_ms: int64, connect_timeout_ms: int64, more: { client_handshake_timeout: int64, dns_ns_timeout_ms: int64, dns_total_timeout_ms: int64, first_frame_timeout_ms: int64 } }, tls: { ca_pem: string, cert_pem: string, key_pem: string, self_fp: string }, token: { token_bytes: int64, token_ttl_sec: int64, whitelist_autoload: boolean, whitelist_default_spec: string } }) | (:error, { record: int64, schema: int64, text: string })

groups:
index (schema 1, once): { frames: int64, kind: string, mode: string, version: int64 }
node (schema 2, once): { creation: int64, name: string }
net (schema 20, once): { listen_address: string, listener: string, plaintext_test_only: boolean, port: int64 }
limits (schema 21, once): { args_len_max: int64, frame_size_max: int64, suspicion_limit: int64, term_depth_max: int64 }
time (schema 22, once): { call_timeout_ms: int64, connect_stagger_ms: int64, connect_timeout_ms: int64, more: { client_handshake_timeout: int64, dns_ns_timeout_ms: int64, dns_total_timeout_ms: int64, first_frame_timeout_ms: int64 } }
token (schema 23, once): { token_bytes: int64, token_ttl_sec: int64, whitelist_autoload: boolean, whitelist_default_spec: string }
session (schema 24, once): { idle_ms: int64, max_age_ms: int64, max_inflight: int64, more: { drain_ms: int64, max_calls: int64 } }
tls (schema 25, once): { ca_pem: string, cert_pem: string, key_pem: string, self_fp: string }
peer (schema 26, many): { cert: string, classical: boolean, fp: string, spec: { all: string, perms: List[{ a: int64, f: string, m: string }, mem(normal)] } }
pin (schema 27, many): { addr: string, fp: string }
